    <string name="trf_fat_share">%1$d %% of energy · guideline %2$d–%3$d %%</string>
    <string name="trf_fat_info">Fat carries the vitamins A, D, E and K and is needed for hormones. Sports nutrition guidance for athletes recommends about 20–35 %% of energy from fat; less than 20 %% is not advised. The share is calculated from the protein, carbohydrate and fat you logged.</string>
