    <string name="trf_reds_title">Enough energy?</string>
    <string name="trf_reds_low_carbs">On several training days your carbohydrates were clearly below what your training needs.</string>
    <string name="trf_reds_other">Your history shows something that can point to too little energy.</string>
    <string name="trf_reds_info">Too little energy over a longer time (RED-S) can affect performance, bones, hormones and mood. CruxCoach does not diagnose anything and logging is never a duty. If you often feel tired, are often ill, your period becomes irregular or performance stalls, talk to a doctor or a sports nutrition professional.</string>
